{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07191","headline":"秋夜雨中诸公过灵光寺所居 · 刘长卿","name":"秋夜雨中诸公过灵光寺所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晤语青莲舍，重门闭夕阴。\n向人寒烛静，带雨夜钟沈。\n流水从他事，孤云任此心。\n不能捐斗粟，终日媿瑶琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}